{"5117590":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Skeleton Island","steam_appid":5117590,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"dlc":[5148430,5258770,5259020,5261440,5261460],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKELETON ISLAND<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up stranded on a mysterious island with no idea how you got there. The island seems abandoned, but something is watching you from the shadows.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island, gather resources, craft tools and weapons, build shelters and fight dangerous enemies as you search for a way to survive.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌲 EXPLORE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover forests, abandoned locations, mysterious places and dangerous areas scattered across the island. Search for resources, hidden secrets and clues about what happened here.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪓 SURVIVE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather wood, stone, iron and other resources. Manage your supplies and use everything you can find to stay alive.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔨 CRAFT &amp; BUILD<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, weapons and useful equipment. Build structures and create your own place to survive the dangers of the island.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ FIGHT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island isn't empty. Hostile creatures and other dangers are waiting for you. Prepare your equipment and fight your way through the island.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 UNCOVER THE MYSTERY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is seriously wrong with this island. Explore abandoned places, discover clues and uncover the secrets hidden beneath the surface.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏝️ YOUR SURVIVAL BEGINS HERE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Craft. Build. Fight. Survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape Skeleton Island — or become another skeleton left behind?<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKELETON ISLAND<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up stranded on a mysterious island with no idea how you got there. The island seems abandoned, but something is watching you from the shadows.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island, gather resources, craft tools and weapons, build shelters and fight dangerous enemies as you search for a way to survive.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌲 EXPLORE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover forests, abandoned locations, mysterious places and dangerous areas scattered across the island. Search for resources, hidden secrets and clues about what happened here.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪓 SURVIVE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather wood, stone, iron and other resources. Manage your supplies and use everything you can find to stay alive.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔨 CRAFT &amp; BUILD<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, weapons and useful equipment. Build structures and create your own place to survive the dangers of the island.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ FIGHT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island isn't empty. Hostile creatures and other dangers are waiting for you. Prepare your equipment and fight your way through the island.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 UNCOVER THE MYSTERY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is seriously wrong with this island. Explore abandoned places, discover clues and uncover the secrets hidden beneath the surface.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏝️ YOUR SURVIVAL BEGINS HERE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Craft. Build. Fight. Survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape Skeleton Island — or become another skeleton left behind?<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"# Short Description Survive on a mysterious island, gather resources, craft weapons and explore dangerous locations while uncovering the dark secrets hidden within. Fight enemies, survive the island and prepare yourself for the final battle.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5117590\/8c29dfb36ffb1e2c13cddc265bc7adee2e7bcc66\/header.jpg?t=1793637543","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5117590\/72b844b8c88d013f0722b096ae1793d3a03c7888\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793637543","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5117590\/72b844b8c88d013f0722b096ae1793d3a03c7888\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793637543","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 3 GB \/ AMD Radeon RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Keyboard and mouse required.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Riabets Artem"],"publishers":["Riabets Artem"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5117590\/6c79b34c9b0f0ecbfaf7732b7dae9215327b7f1b\/ss_6c79b34c9b0f0ecbfaf7732b7dae9215327b7f1b.600x338.jpg?t=1793637543","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5117590\/6c79b34c9b0f0ecbfaf7732b7dae9215327b7f1b\/ss_6c79b34c9b0f0ecbfaf7732b7dae9215327b7f1b.1920x1080.jpg?t=179363